tengine/godot/pulls/123618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123618","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123618.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123618.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`Node::_duplicate` isn't fully tested and there are a number of recent issues about it:\r\n- #123616\r\n- #111091\r\n- #121848\r\n- (Not an exhaustive list)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis shouldn't be merged until at least #121848 is fixed since these tests expose that.\r\n\r\nI'll note that my PR #123347 does fix issue #121848 and these tests pass with that PR.\r\n\r\nThis adds some tests for a more complex scene tree which looks like this:\r\n```\r\nmain_instance                     | owner: null_ptr\r\n`- main_instance_child            | owner: main_instance\r\n   `- subscene_instance           | owner: main_instance\r\n      `- subscene_instance_child  | owner: subscene_instance\r\n         `- local_grandchild \t  | owner: main_instance\r\n      `- local_child \t\t\t  | owner: main_instance\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe current tests for Node are good but don't cover any more involved scenarios with multiple scene instances in one tree, and the lack of unit testing for more involved scenarios is leading to more issues / bugs.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123618/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123618/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}